---
title: "getLegionAddress (LegionAddressRegistry)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_lookup: receive(id)
    q_lookup --> q_check: addr = registry[id]
    q_check --> q_return: addr != address(0)
    q_check --> q_revert_not_found: addr == address(0)
    q_revert_not_found --> [*]: revert address not found
    q_return --> [*]: return addr

    note right of q_lookup
        INV-001: returned address matches stored value for given id
        INV-002: reverts if no address registered for id
    end note
